{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/dc14758aa8a7fea7af5646265d1a9ea5.poster.avif?t=1773248543\" width=614 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/dc14758aa8a7fea7af5646265d1a9ea5.webm?t=1773248543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/dc14758aa8a7fea7af5646265d1a9ea5.mp4?t=1773248543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hi, I'm Ai!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a relationship robot, and my mission is to enjoy happy moments with you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's do fun activities every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook together and play various games. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you and me. If there will be someone else...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never leave me, okay? \u2665</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's stay together forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'll take good care of you, my darling. I love you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/8ec4fb3231e18cd1cd8651c4c5265e79.poster.avif?t=1773248543\" width=630 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/8ec4fb3231e18cd1cd8651c4c5265e79.webm?t=1773248543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/8ec4fb3231e18cd1cd8651c4c5265e79.mp4?t=1773248543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Love Ai is a game where you develop a relationship with an android robot named Ai, and your dialogue choices influence the ending.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day you decided to buy new android girlfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/cf13421be799d3f6c89b3a2bf3690080.avif?t=1773248543\" width=1560 height=988 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/c40f702938d73255813d795759d41ba3.avif?t=1773248543\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play mini games with Ai Onuki.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation you have will either bring you closer to her or push you further away. Every response you give will change the destiny of your relationship.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your answers change game's ending.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Date with android girlfriend.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the interesting future story with colorful anime graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/3226e757117ca37e8e4e12af00399a03.poster.avif?t=1773248543\" width=630 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/3226e757117ca37e8e4e12af00399a03.webm?t=1773248543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826970/extras/3226e757117ca37e8e4e12af00399a03.mp4?t=1773248543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to touch Ai's heart?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game isn't recommended for the people easily disturbed.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My new android girlfriend.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/8fcc42a7a426d755557728e98ba48e010b739f81.jpg"},{"name":"I Am Angry!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/c53e2e8aab810f9e85dd37c2c1d40ec5d2cb51e2.jpg"},{"name":"Chief","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/d179187eb1590a8225445ade29026c636f51599a.jpg"},{"name":"RK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/44021bd7d5ac8f8a80c74af965ff29e5554cf0f3.jpg"},{"name":"First lose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/aef23118411b3c2a41c2cada6ccf7b842180f625.jpg"},{"name":"Fix your love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/7ee14f9a9e5e79da814e11eed72ace55ad36664f.jpg"},{"name":"Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/a0e8b35012d195ac8ab2dd1793c1ad224b27ea4b.jpg"},{"name":"Free throw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/c43523301921f553918e3b9177d46028afd7ab8f.jpg"},{"name":"Pure Thoughts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/c5b47bfdf9d1160bad966157612f913b060ba6df.jpg"},{"name":"Meow!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3826970/7c77bf28158b894b6ea5d69ac94d23ce9b33724f.jpg"}],"total":14},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826970?t=1773248543","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826970?t=1773248543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite